            <rect x='64' y='96' width='548' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='64' y='96' width='548' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='82' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.7 三大部署坑：ALLOWED_HOSTS、colle…</text><text x='82' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 坑一：ALLOWED_HOSTS 不改，线上直接 400。 Django 会检查每个请求的 Host…</text><text x='82' y='197.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 坑二：DEBUG = False 之后，不 collectstatic 就是一个白脸页面。 DEBUG…</text><text x='82' y='226.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 坑三：把本地数据库和虚拟环境传上云。 必须写 .gitignore：</text><rect x='668' y='96' width='548' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='668' y='96' width='548' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='686' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.8 定制错误页面与「继续开发」（对应教材 20.2）</text><text x='686' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 如果想更精细地控制错误行为（比如 404 时也要查数据库、按不同错误码返回不同页面</text><text x='686' y='188.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>），可以在 urls…</text><text x='686' y='217.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 「继续开发」的流程是部署之后最重要的工作流。首次上线只是开始，之后每次改 bug</text><text x='686' y='236.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>、加功能，都是这一个循…</text><text x='686' y='265.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 你的代码库里同时住着两个环境，git 提交是本地唯一的真相来源，platform push 是</text><text x='686' y='284.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>把真相同…</text><text x='64' y='470' fontSize='14.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#0E9B78' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>本节的代码示例</text><text x='64' y='500' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 同一份代码，两个环境（config_switcher.py）</text><text x='468' y='500' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 给 requirements.txt 做入职体检（requirem…</text><text x='872' y='500' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 400 Bad Request 是怎么来的（host_check.…</text><rect x='64' y='574' width='1152' height='66' rx='12' fill='#EEF5FB' /><text x='84' y='616' fontSize='14' fill='#243444' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>看不懂的地方先回讲义对应小节读一遍，再回来对着这页复述一次——能讲出来才算真懂。</text>
